        "id": 249499,
        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2022-11-22T18:03:46.765Z",
        "cooked": "<p>“I express skepticality as a free action.” Marvelous.</p>\n<p>Thursday at 11, you say? MIGHT BE TIME TO JOIN THE PATREON AGAIN</p>\n<p>Now I’m wondering if the “need to have had a Play and Power Phase” ruling would negate the cheese possible from a card like La Comodora’s Helm, assuming such a thing happens in DE.</p>\n<p>Cauldron was way ahead of them with “at the end of your draw phase” anyway. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=12\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\"></p>\n<p>Suddenly <em>very</em> excited about Definitive Chrono-Ranger.</p>\n<p>It takes all types of flesh to make a flesh rainbow.</p>\n<p>Empire of the Sun is a really great band!</p>\n<p>And that’s all my notes, save to say this was fun!</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2022-11-22T18:03:46.765Z",
