        "raw": "\"I express skepticality as a free action.\" Marvelous.\n\nThursday at 11, you say? MIGHT BE TIME TO JOIN THE PATREON AGAIN\n\nNow I'm wondering if the \"need to have had a Play and Power Phase\" ruling would negate the cheese possible from a card like La Comodora's Helm, assuming such a thing happens in DE.\n\nCauldron was way ahead of them with \"at the end of your draw phase\" anyway. :P\n\nSuddenly *very* excited about Definitive Chrono-Ranger.\n\nIt takes all types of flesh to make a flesh rainbow.\n\nEmpire of the Sun is a really great band!\n\nAnd that's all my notes, save to say this was fun!",
