        "cooked": "<p>I appreciate how my semi-regularly mentioning I wanted a Fright Train/AZ teamup just for the sheer pun potential, combined with Maglev’s love of train-based everything, led to somebody suggesting this particular episode idea. Inspiring insanity is one of my favorite things to accomplish.</p>",
